Problem:
- High jitter (~40 ms)
- High latency under load (~70 ms)

Solution:
- Enabled Smart Queues on UniFi UCG-Max
- Tuned to 420 Mbps down / 20 Mbps up

Results:
- Jitter reduced to ~5 ms
- Stable gaming performance
- No packet loss
- Base latency ~30 ms

Conclusion:
- Bufferbloat was primary issue
- SQM resolved instability
